Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:12:08 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add single-server deploy (MongoDB + Garage + API + Caddy)
 for test/starter VPS

- deploy/single/install.sh: generates secrets, configures Garage, builds and starts everything
- Caddy: automatic HTTPS, SPA, /api, /media and same-origin S3 (no CORS needed)
- tuned for 1 GB RAM + swap

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
